comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T15:23:47.373Z",pi-agent,"Upgraded pm-changelog from 2026.8.17 to 2026.8.29 and changed the executable verifier probe to 2026.1.2-2. npm run verify:release-changelog-date, npm test, and npm run release:check pass, with 100% coverage. Regression proof: reinstalling 2026.8.17 while retaining the suffixed probe made the verifier exit nonzero because --date-from-version rejected 2026.1.2-2; restoring package.json and package-lock.json plus npm ci passed."
